---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Methodology | Word And Mouth" description="Listen. Dig. Deliver. How we find the problem behind the problem.">
  <section class="methodology-hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <a href="/problems/" class="back-link">← What's Your Problem?</a>
      <h1>How We Work</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">Every business has a problem they're solving wrong. We find it. We fix it.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="formula-section">
    <div class="formula-box">
      <div class="formula-step">
        <span class="formula-word">Listen.</span>
        <p>We hear what you think the problem is. We talk to your team, your customers, your competitors. We gather the evidence.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-step">
        <span class="formula-word">Dig.</span>
        <p>We find the problem behind the problem. The thing everyone's overlooking. The trivial error causing the catastrophic result.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-step">
        <span class="formula-word">Deliver.</span>
        <p>We build the unexpected solution. Not the obvious fix. The one that actually works because it addresses what's actually broken.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="framework-section">
    <h2>The PROBLEM Framework</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">A deceptively simple methodology. Seven steps on the surface. Layers of complexity beneath for those who want to master it.</p>
    
    <div class="framework-grid">
      <div class="framework-step">
        <span class="step-letter">P</span>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Perceive</h3>
          <p>What do they <em>think</em> the problem is?</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="framework-step">
        <span class="step-letter">R</span>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Reframe</h3>
          <p>What's the problem <em>behind</em> the problem?</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="framework-step">
        <span class="step-letter">O</span>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Orient</h3>
          <p>What domain is this? Simple, Complicated, Complex, or Chaotic?</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="framework-step">
        <span class="step-letter">B</span>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Build</h3>
          <p>What's the unexpected solution?</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="framework-step">
        <span class="step-letter">L</span>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Launch</h3>
          <p>How do we test it fast?</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="framework-step">
        <span class="step-letter">E</span>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Evolve</h3>
          <p>What did we learn? What's next?</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="framework-step">
        <span class="step-letter">M</span>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Measure</h3>
          <p>Is the original problem actually solved?</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="resources-section">
    <h2>Go Deeper</h2>
    
    <div class="resource-grid">
      <a href="/arsenal/bookshelf/" class="resource-card">
        <span class="resource-icon">📚</span>
        <h3>The Arsenal</h3>
        <p>15 books that shape how we think about problems. With a prescription quiz to find your starting point.</p>
      </a>
      
      <a href="/methodology/playbook/" class="resource-card coming">
        <span class="resource-icon">📖</span>
        <h3>The Playbook</h3>
        <p>Solved to Sold: The 5-phase process for creating solution stories that drive sustained success.</p>
        <span class="coming-tag">Coming Soon</span>
      </a>
      
      <a href="/methodology/frameworks/" class="resource-card coming">
        <span class="resource-icon">🔧</span>
        <h3>Frameworks</h3>
        <p>Cynefin, Pre-Mortem, 5 Whys, Root Cause Analysis — the tools we use and how to apply them.</p>
        <span class="coming-tag">Coming Soon</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-section">
    <h2>Ready to Find Your Real Problem?</h2>
    <p>Most businesses are solving the wrong thing brilliantly. Let's find what actually needs fixing.</p>
    <a href="mailto:dave@wordandmouth.com?subject=Let's find my real problem" class="cta-button">Start the Conversation →</a>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .methodology-hero {
    padding: 10rem 2rem 4rem;
    text-align: center;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0a0a0a 0%, #111 100%);
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .methodology-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .formula-section {
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .formula-box {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .formula-step {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .formula-word {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .formula-step p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .framework-section {
    background: #0a0a0a;
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
  }

  .framework-section h2 {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .section-intro {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .framework-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .framework-step {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
    background: #111;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 1.25rem;
    width: calc(50% - 0.5rem);
    min-width: 280px;
  }

  .step-letter {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    line-height: 1;
    min-width: 40px;
  }

  .step-content h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .step-content p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .resources-section {
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .resources-section h2 {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .resource-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .resource-card {
    background: #111;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 2rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    position: relative;
  }

  .resource-card:not(.coming):hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .resource-card.coming {
    opacity: 0.6;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .resource-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    display: block;
  }

  .resource-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .resource-card p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .coming-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--muted);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
  }

  .cta-section {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
    background: #0f0f0f;
  }

  .cta-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .cta-section p {
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 500px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .cta-button {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #000;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .cta-button:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.3);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .methodology-hero {
      padding: 8rem 1.5rem 3rem;
    }

    .framework-step {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
